# Electron 运行时二进制不走 npm registry，而是从 GitHub Releases 下载。
# 国内直连 GitHub 极慢甚至完全卡住。这里改用淘宝 npmmirror 镜像。
electron_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/

# electron-builder 打包时还会去 GitHub 下载 winCodeSign 等工具包，同样会被卡住。
electron_builder_binaries_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron-builder-binaries/
